<title>BRAZIL: Brazil March 28 coffee regs 3.66 mln bags to May.</title>
<headline>Brazil March 28 coffee regs 3.66 mln bags to May.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of March 28 totalled 3.66 million bags for March, April and May, according to the April 16 bulletin of Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> March		  1,381,337</p>
<p> April		  1,583,838</p>
<p> May			691,860</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,657,035</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
